                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The Stalin SubwayL Red Veil has a few minor problems with moving around. Been stuck in a few places, but no problem with going back to a save and try again. \n\nThe custom engine has some interesting aspects but the animation problems take away form the engine abilities. The game is largely a dungeon crawler. \n\nThis game is crude, but playable. This game needs a lot more work on it. To set  the resolution above 640x480, there is a config tool in the game folder. Played this on my Dell XPS 9570 with GTX 1050 Ti Max Q 4GB. My Dell has 3840x2160 UHD graphics.  Game is very playable.",
